{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mrJskDtpgf1793338260.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>雲南大理一名女子，早上用豆漿送服鈣片時，感覺被卡住，喉嚨奇痛無比。她去到當地醫院的耳鼻喉科就診，醫生表示鈣片遇到人體體液，一般可以自行溶解，很難持續卡在咽喉部位。</p><p></p><p>經過進一步的胃鏡和CT檢查，發現女子食道內有一片鋒利的金屬異物卡住。女子的家人確認後，發現家中的豆漿機刀片，真的少了一塊。醫生隨即做手術，幫女子取出異物。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"_cgi-bin_mmwebwx-bin_webwxgetmsgimg__&amp;MsgID=7845143676711208537&amp;skey=@crypt_3fa05ea8_9c97415ab24a93170d61c743578346d5&amp;mmweb_appid=wx_webfilehelper.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202646F3EBST4w1793338304.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>大批網友表示驚訝，那麼大的一塊刀片，怎麼吞下去。還有網友起哄，說投訴豆漿機的生產廠家，產品質量問題。</p><p></p><p>醫生提醒，消化道異物屬於臨床急症，尤其是誤吞魚骨的案例特別多。如果發生食道消化道異物的情況，切勿自行用吞飯團、喝醋等偏方處理，應立即就醫，以免尖銳異物割傷食道，加重損傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.399799+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:58:16.474966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:37.998892+00:00","content_hash":"87197e5d554bf53b6a4e0c739c812eb9115dad44c1046112852aeb436ae8f668","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.399799+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}